1. **Clock Setup:** Configures the internal HSI16 and PLL to scale the system to 170 MHz (Range 1 Boost) with 4 Flash wait states [RM0440 p.90].
2. **USART3:** Routed to `PC10` (TX) and `PC11` (RX) via `AF7`. Baud rate register (`BRR`) is set to $170\text{ MHz} / 115200 = 1476$.
